{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10275050","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10275050","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1027505001:1":{"text":"They really exist... the legendary <style=\"highlight\">Tears of Misarte</style>.","source_cn":"居然真的存在……传说中的<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DED09C0DFBE8771","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1027505002:1":{"text":"It's said while roaming in the Dark Forest, the Deer Spirit was so moved by its beauty that its tears fell and transformed into magical flora.","source_cn":"据说，鹿灵在薄暮丛林中漫游时，被此处的生机所感动，流淌...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x562129E8EB762B35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1027505003:1":{"text":"Many refer to this precious gift as the Resurrection Grass, for it can cure all ailments and even ward off death...","source_cn":"它又被称为弥生露草，因为它能够起死回生，包治百病……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53F69F1734E2C028","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1027505003":{"text":"Many refer to this precious gift as the Resurrection Grass, for it can cure all ailments and even ward off death...","source_cn":"它又被称为弥生露草，因为它能够起死回生，包治百病……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53F69F1734E2C028","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1027505004:1":{"text":"To be clear, the grass cannot reverse death, but rather restore a gravely ill person to full health, given that they still draw breath.","source_cn":"严格来说，不能逆转生死，但是濒死者只要还有一口气，凭借...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B5342510590B818","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1027505006:1":{"text":"This is... amazing! Billie, do you hear that? You're going to live!","source_cn":"太、太好了，太好了太好了！米利！！听到了吗！你的病有救了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE20C4F0FB95D7A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1027505007:1":{"text":"Endless thanks to Misarte, to the forest, to everyone and everything... my wish has come true!","source_cn":"感谢弥萨忒的恩赐，感谢您，感谢一切，天啊，我的愿望实现了——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BAC7731D789C02A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1027505008:1":{"text":"Hold on a second.","source_cn":"——等一下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x815599D3D58F1F88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1027505008":{"text":"Hold on a second.","source_cn":"——等一下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x815599D3D58F1F88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1027505009:1":{"text":"Sorry to rain on your parade... but I'm taking the treasure.","source_cn":"抱歉啊，在别人喜极而泣的时候泼冷水——但是，这份宝藏，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEB8D3F5351941E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1027505011:1":{"text":"No! This is Billie's only hope!","source_cn":"不、不行，这是米利活下去的希望，绝对不能给你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DBD528072AC824C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1027505012:1":{"text":"I'm sorry it's come to this, little girl, and though you might not believe me... I understand your plight more than anyone...","source_cn":"……抱歉，这么说你多半也不会相信，但是，小姑娘，你的心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FBCC591917317E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1027505013:1":{"text":"And for that reason, I must have it.","source_cn":"所以，正因如此，我绝对不会放手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1471ED084E5CB52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1027505014:1":{"text":"Why the shocked faces? Isn't it normal for there to be quarrels at the end of a treasure hunt when there isn't enough to go around?","source_cn":"别露出那种表情嘛，各位，在寻宝之后分赃不均——好吧，分...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0F92156C3EB93DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1027505014":{"text":"Why the shocked faces? Isn't it normal for there to be quarrels at the end of a treasure hunt when there isn't enough to go around?","source_cn":"别露出那种表情嘛，各位，在寻宝之后分赃不均——好吧，分配不均而起内讧的情况不是很正常吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0F92156C3EB93DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1027505015:1":{"text":"That's... no one's business but my own.","source_cn":"……这和我们要争夺的东西无关吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6DDDA3DFBC3D4C2E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"That's... no one's business but my own.","female":"That's... no one's business but my own.","variant_male_record_index":"108097","variant_female_record_index":"108098","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1027505015":{"text":"That's... no one's business but my own.","source_cn":"……这和我们要争夺的东西无关吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6DDDA3DFBC3D4C2E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"That's... no one's business but my own.","female":"That's... no one's business but my own.","variant_male_record_index":"108097","variant_female_record_index":"108098","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1027505016:1":{"text":"It's... not possible.\nEven though it appears to be grass, these are the Tears of Misarte—essentially a dewdrop infused with divine power, which cannot be split apart.","source_cn":"当、当然不可能……\\n虽然是草的样子，但这是弥萨忒的泪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C82E5D882CE5158","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1027505017:1":{"text":"Additionally, if they leave Misarte's protection, they'll evaporate instantly. This means that the Resurrection Grass can't be taken out of the forest.","source_cn":"一旦试图分开就会化为雾气，回归丛林。如果离开弥萨忒的守...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3913CA8AA4E83B2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:25:1027505017":{"text":"Additionally, if they leave Misarte's protection, they'll evaporate instantly. This means that the Resurrection Grass can't be taken out of the forest.","source_cn":"一旦试图分开就会化为雾气，回归丛林。如果离开弥萨忒的守护范围，也会瞬间蒸发……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3913CA8AA4E83B2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1027505018:1":{"text":"That's right, the blessings of Misarte have long been infused with the plants of the Dark Forest. Treasures like this will gradually lose their effectiveness with distance, even at the forest's edge.","source_cn":"是的，弥萨忒的祝福早已浸润在薄暮丛林的植物当中，像这种...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81935652D5BE23EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1027505019:1":{"text":"When I took two pots of common herbs away from the Dark Forest as a child, they withered instantly, losing their evergreen hues.","source_cn":"我当年离开丛林的时候，带了两盆普通的花。结果在路上就枯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16C31565F77C30FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:30:1027505019":{"text":"When I took two pots of common herbs away from the Dark Forest as a child, they withered instantly, losing their evergreen hues.","source_cn":"我当年离开丛林的时候，带了两盆普通的花。结果在路上就枯萎了，不像在薄暮丛林一样常青……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16C31565F77C30FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1027505020:1":{"text":"It... can't leave this forest...?","source_cn":"……不能带走……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1440ED3AF7EC3116","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1027505021:1":{"text":"Alas, I suppose I'll be charitable here and give up my claim.\nIt seems occasionally, learning some devout details would prevent making a fool of oneself.","source_cn":"唉，枉做恶人。\\n看起来这些虔诚的知识偶尔学上一点儿，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14D373E00AC73A7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1027505022:1":{"text":"Never mind. Wilder girl, you take it. I hope your friend recovers soon.","source_cn":"算了，绿裔的妹子，你拿走吧，希望你的朋友早日恢复健康。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF35B0DFC79A34F90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1027505023:0":{"text":"It's time I leave...","source_cn":"我先走了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78F8D4F4D0C116F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:37:1027505023":{"text":"It's time I leave...","source_cn":"我先走了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78F8D4F4D0C116F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1027505024:1":{"text":"It's fine, it's all yours.","source_cn":"都归你了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x69546B10B3DB075F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's fine, it's all yours.","female":"It's fine, it's all yours.","variant_male_record_index":"108107","variant_female_record_index":"108108","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:39:1027505024":{"text":"It's fine, it's all yours.","source_cn":"都归你了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x69546B10B3DB075F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's fine, it's all yours.","female":"It's fine, it's all yours.","variant_male_record_index":"108107","variant_female_record_index":"108108","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1027505025:1":{"text":"Ha... You saw through me yet again.","source_cn":"……哈。又被你看穿了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x00557EEFE1D0FC84","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Ha... You saw through me yet again.","female":"Ha... You saw through me yet again.","variant_male_record_index":"108109","variant_female_record_index":"108110","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1027505026:1":{"text":"I can't have what I want, and the rest of the treasures are meaningless to me.","source_cn":"没错，我想要的东西无法得手，剩下的这些也不值得讨价还价。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x21C26A7EBAA82449","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I can't have what I want, and the rest of the treasures are meaningless to me.","female":"I can't have what I want, and the rest of the treasures are meaningless to me.","variant_male_record_index":"108111","variant_female_record_index":"108112","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1027505027:1":{"text":"So I, most generously, leave it to you—call it a reward for your wisdom and acumen.","source_cn":"所以就大方送给你了——就当是为了感谢你的敏锐和智慧吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF4224A15483FB61A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"So I, most generously, leave it to you—call it a reward for your wisdom and acumen.","female":"So I, most generously, leave it to you—call it a reward for your wisdom and acumen.","variant_male_record_index":"108113","variant_female_record_index":"108114","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1027505028:1":{"text":"Ah, yes, and something for you two...\nHere, catch!","source_cn":"啊，对了对了，有东西要给你们……\\n嘿！接好了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B429003EE2D76E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1027505029:1":{"text":"Is this... a gemstone?","source_cn":"这个是………宝石？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C3C19084AEA166C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:45:1027505029":{"text":"Is this... a gemstone?","source_cn":"这个是………宝石？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C3C19084AEA166C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1027505030:1":{"text":"You've got a good eye.","source_cn":"眼光不错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49B27D8139C1AD12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1027505031:1":{"text":"Think of it as a token of good luck from me to you.","source_cn":"就当是恭贺恢复健康的贺礼吧，贵重点不好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83C5025F773CF301","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1027505032:1":{"text":"Well, I'll leave you to it, then. Farewell!","source_cn":"那么，我先走了，告辞！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC615AFBCE223283D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:45:0:1":{"text":"The gem used in the offering!","source_cn":"是那块作为祭品的宝石","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x48439AC418BEEC54","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The gem used in the offering!","female":"The gem used in the offering!","variant_male_record_index":"60866","variant_female_record_index":"60867","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:45:1:2":{"text":"Doesn't it mean a lot to you?","source_cn":"你不是很珍惜这个吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE760C3D16CA17B75","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Doesn't it mean a lot to you?","female":"Doesn't it mean a lot to you?","variant_male_record_index":"60868","variant_female_record_index":"60869","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:39:0:1":{"text":"There's nothing else you want?","source_cn":"这里没有你想要的了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x80B499BBD25DCB00","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"There's nothing else you want?","female":"There's nothing else you want?","variant_male_record_index":"60864","variant_female_record_index":"60865","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:37:0:1":{"text":"Not interested in other riches?","source_cn":"剩下的宝贝，你不要了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC6464730FC8ADFA7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Not interested in other riches?","female":"Not interested in other riches?","variant_male_record_index":"60860","variant_female_record_index":"60861","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:37:1:2":{"text":"We did agree to split things equally.","source_cn":"竟然对其他财富无动于衷","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE098B0AE1B0244C6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We did agree to split things equally.","female":"We did agree to split things equally.","variant_male_record_index":"60862","variant_female_record_index":"60863","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:30:0:1":{"text":"Atalanta, you heard her.","source_cn":"阿塔兰忒，你听到了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6371670A32D5AF7A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Atalanta, you heard her.","female":"Atalanta, you heard her.","variant_male_record_index":"60856","variant_female_record_index":"60857","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:30:1:2":{"text":"Are you gonna keep fighting?","source_cn":"还要继续争夺吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3B4208A22B678F47","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Are you gonna keep fighting?","female":"Are you gonna keep fighting?","variant_male_record_index":"60858","variant_female_record_index":"60859","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:25:0:1":{"text":"It can only be used in the forest?","source_cn":"只能在丛林内使用？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x97E14414DA4D2141","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It can only be used in the forest?","female":"It can only be used in the forest?","variant_male_record_index":"60854","variant_female_record_index":"60855","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:20:0:1":{"text":"Lyca, can't it be split equally?","source_cn":"莱卡，它可以平分吗？","status":"matched_runtime